{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "8e57fc88ff98072aec37f01c5edbae95e7da2432980f0d23227bf8225a5ccd64", "ja": "バラエティ番組　撮影後", "zh": "综艺节目　录影后", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4000_place", "source_sha256": "df7371d7b211604d281d520e27f89504463b815c8505645ff8c60199ef43cb3f", "ja": "書店", "zh": "书店", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "01e8c1b3f607dc458cb44e30f51b27ebf8881f4ac807d4c300147b50e2a2833f", "ja": "うう、{$P$}さん……。\n私、もう恥ずかしくて、この番組には出られません～！", "zh": "呜呜，{$P$}先生……\n我实在太丢脸，再也没勇气参加这个节目了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4002_p", "source_sha256": "8d4c949952367a5196c35b757caab7dd215324415de957bff6c8ace4e1729b07", "ja": "どうした、風花？", "zh": "怎么了，风花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4fb2b4dbfc7b97f4fd338bb1372be16938d4ddc28734d1addd6cfbd076b31bd3", "ja": "思いっきり転んで、カメラの目の前で、あんな格好\nしちゃうなんて……わ、私、もうお嫁にいけない……！", "zh": "竟然跌了个大跤，在摄影机前露出那种模样……\n我、我嫁不出去了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4004_p", "source_sha256": "366cbca2505b9d63e8b147f06922f19dd45ef4c26d39e193cd3b25e3784a8033", "ja": "（恥ずかしさのあまり、取り乱しているみたいだな。\nなんとか落ち着かせないと……）", "zh": "（看来是因为太过羞耻而乱了阵脚啊，\n得让她冷静下来才行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4005_p", "source_sha256": "8a8f03d1ed18c0a0683258ca7d35533f6a016c7aefa9bb53bfe0b19dccc32432", "ja": "風花、さっきのポーズだけど……。", "zh": "风花，你刚刚的姿势……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4006", "source_sha256": "42f7b03c714b36b303b606d927c438c3ccf27356a322d58f4a243b4f624bf79b", "ja": "大受けだったぞ", "zh": "大获好评喔", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4007", "source_sha256": "ad8db4f6476493552c7587ae9081175c0a0ce4054b5afd8002694e7077a55431", "ja": "アイドルらしいぞ！", "zh": "很有偶像风范喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4008", "source_sha256": "3ea44155799ed069ced28542c5d81c0d179c4db518cc12a5798c3a9ff3a426f2", "ja": "最高にセクシーだ！", "zh": "实在太性感了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4100_p", "source_sha256": "ad33a734a387007e41afe3537a9baf4c3069d951abd54075bb29da00f4c912ae", "ja": "現場は、大受けだったぞ！　おかげで\n収録も盛り上がって、いい雰囲気を作れたんだ。", "zh": "在拍摄现场大获好评喔！多亏有你，\n录影时十分热烈，现场气氛也变得很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4101_p", "source_sha256": "4449a355567ac1d8baafee1b884864d84f1a1bdc28e58ed295c3203e47558727", "ja": "だから、そんなに気にすることなんかない。\nむしろ自信を持つべきだ！", "zh": "所以你不需要这么在意，\n反而应该拿出自信才是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4102_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fe1fcbbfa4d6c09bd1f7bd92640c1dc4595733cc589d13bcf5862f6380118c50", "ja": "そ、そうですか……？　確かに、すごく恥ずかしかった\nけど、一生懸命やった結果ですから……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗……？虽然实在是很丢脸，\n但也是拚命参与的结果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4103_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1d76bf12239bd6275b922cef07a77089c00920c390482edc27344a637208a6ed", "ja": "いいお仕事ができてたなら、嬉しいな……♪\nありがとうございます、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "如果效果很好的话，我也很开心……♪\n谢谢你，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4300_p", "source_sha256": "45a7836c2b4c8b6af9de01c347cda445e2451c65f4b15ac78d256b7030d13995", "ja": "すごく、正統派のアイドルって感じだったぞ！", "zh": "很有正统派偶像的感觉喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4301_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6672184337ffb1a0594c1bdfb1da65cd8ede32ae575f40e9938aa7fa13ddaf0f", "ja": "えっ……正統派？　さっきのが、ですか？", "zh": "咦……正统派？像刚刚那样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4302_p", "source_sha256": "6511ba836f1c31b2421cd54b22a112a1fa28fd1e7e45109923d864ee73a67de4", "ja": "ああ。カメラの前で思わずドジってしまうなんて、\nまさにアイドルの王道。正統派って感じじゃないか？", "zh": "是啊，在摄影机前暴露冒失的模样，\n正是偶像的王道。不是很有正统派的感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4303_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4240cc56e7328c4b6e850fb75fb95675a701e455ad1c908858cf951d153bd0ab", "ja": "確かに、そうかも……。\n私、正統派アイドルっぽい……ですか？　うふふっ♪", "zh": "也许真的是吧……\n我像是正统派偶像……是吗？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4304_p", "source_sha256": "667d9777f72afa7f06b85c2e54677aabf6dff0197b0489ddbd5e33a184095cd0", "ja": "（そして風花は、次の収録にも張りきって挑み……\n風花の起こすハプニングは番組恒例になったのだった）", "zh": "（于是风花在下次录影中也全力挑战……\n风花引起的突发事件成了节目的惯例。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4200_p", "source_sha256": "5cb3446a8dbdbc8411cedd95be24c1ce11521fa0874b7bdb797c383bbe62b61f", "ja": "最高にセクシーで、すばらしかったぞ！\nこう、風花の魅力全開な感じで……。", "zh": "实在太性感，太棒了！\n简直是展现出风花的浑身魅力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4201_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2fceb2f17d5cbcab022727a9f2d2c0eeedbff6497256de5fa7b52925c4c30b62", "ja": "そ、そんなぁ～……。\n私は、正統派のアイドルを目指してるのに……。", "zh": "怎、怎么会这样……\n我明明是以正统派偶像为目标……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4202_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4ae9d64a5c109f129d73b5b3800549a6e5104ed2532a1809bb38d5e1b16f774c", "ja": "{$P$}さん。私、決めました！\nもう、セクシー路線は封印します！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我决定了！\n从今以后，我要封印性感路线！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_4203_041fuk", "source_sha256": "cd23c0ed1ab138dd17c656545f3baeacd4382e62c32a18d7c7acc6d8bbcc60fc", "ja": "そ、そんな悲しそうな顔しても、ダメですっ！\n……ダメなんですから、ね～っ？", "zh": "就、就算你露出那么悲伤的表情也不行！\n……我说不行就是不行，懂了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
